Tomb Raider III: The Lost Artefact for the PlayStation (tr3-lost-artefact-psx)

Copyright (c) 2026 XeNoN3560. All rights reserved.

This covers the parts made in this continuation of the project: the disc
builder (tools/builder), the Python tools in tools/, the patches and level
changes added since, the disc layouts as changed here, the documentation, the
screenshots, the covers and the icon. The parts that come from b122251's
original project and from FindingTheLost's work remain theirs.

You may:
  - read the files and learn from them,
  - download the disc builder and build disc images for your own use,
  - fork this repository on GitHub to suggest changes here, as an issue or a
    pull request.

Without written permission you may not:
  - publish modified versions of the project or of the disc builder,
  - redistribute the project or parts of it elsewhere,
  - release it, or a project based on it, as your own.

Parts under their own licences:
  - b122251's tools in tools/src (trmod, tr3pcpsx, texmod, troi, tr3mesh,
    trsfx, tric, applyips and the others): the GNU General Public License as
    stated in their sources.
  - mkpsxiso by Lameguy64 (tools/src/mkpsxiso): GNU General Public License
    version 2 (tools/src/mkpsxiso/LICENSE.md).

b122251's original project: https://gitlab.com/b122251/tr3gpsx

